    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927769
    m_Localized: All
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927770
    m_Localized: Knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927771
    m_Localized: With an empty magazine, holding the trigger keeps firing from the reserve at half the fire rate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927772
    m_Localized: While aiming, the rifle fires up to 5 bullets together in a single hit, every 0.4 s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927773
    m_Localized: 'Charged shot: holding the trigger charges in 3 stages and, on release, fires 2, 4 or 6 bullets in a row.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927774
    m_Localized: Every 3 pistol hits, your primary weapon fires one shot on its own toward the crosshair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927775
    m_Localized: Your primary weapon gets double the magazine, but you lose your secondary for the rest of the match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927776
    m_Localized: Grenades that hit an invader directly stick to it for 1 s and explode with double damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927777
    m_Localized: The shotgun fires 2 shells at once, using both.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927778
    m_Localized: While aiming, the pellets fly together as a single projectile with no spread and the same damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927779
    m_Localized: The first time the magazine runs empty, it reloads instantly from the reserve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927780
    m_Localized: After a headshot kill, you can fire again after 0.2 s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927781
    m_Localized: Without aiming, it fires with no spread and at double the fire rate. While aiming, it fires normally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927782
    m_Localized: Killing removes the pause between the next 3 bursts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927783
    m_Localized: Each kill adds one bullet to your bursts, up to 6. Reloading resets them to 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927784
    m_Localized: Grenades that touch the ground stay as mines (up to 5).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927785
    m_Localized: From now on, stations refill all your ammo instead of half.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927786
    m_Localized: 40% more reserve ammo for both weapons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927787
    m_Localized: Each headshot kill returns 5 bullets to the magazine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927788
    m_Localized: Knife kills reload the last weapon you held.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927789
    m_Localized: 1 in 5 invaders drops a magazine when it dies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927790
    m_Localized: The knife kills invaders with 25% health or less in one hit (except the Boss).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927791
    m_Localized: Each knife hit heals as much as the damage it deals, up to 25 health per hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927792
    m_Localized: Your holstered weapon reloads itself from its reserve after 2 s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927793
    m_Localized: When an invader hits you, your next shot adds 5 times the health you lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927794
    m_Localized: 'Magazine and reserve are a single pool: you never reload until you run out of bullets.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927795
    m_Localized: The station's choice opens as soon as it's charged, without waiting for the wave to end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7513927796
    m_Localized: When the station is charged, a bubble pushes invaders in the ring back 10 m, except the Boss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
