    m_Localized: We sent another code.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122137
    m_Localized: 'Wrong email address? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122138
    m_Localized: Change it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122139
    m_Localized: CONFIRM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122140
    m_Localized: "CONFIRMING\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122141
    m_Localized: RESET PASSWORD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122142
    m_Localized: Enter your email and we will send you a code to choose a new password.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122143
    m_Localized: SEND CODE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122144
    m_Localized: "SENDING\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122145
    m_Localized: NEW PASSWORD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122146
    m_Localized: If an account exists for that email, a 6-digit code has been sent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122147
    m_Localized: CODE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122148
    m_Localized: CHANGE AND SIGN IN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122149
    m_Localized: "CHANGING\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122150
    m_Localized: Password changed. You are signed in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122151
    m_Localized: PRIVACY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122152
    m_Localized: PRIVACY NOTICE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122153
    m_Localized: WHAT WE STORE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122154
    m_Localized: Your email and password (encrypted), your name, your progress (achievements, cosmetics and currency), your match statistics and the feedback you send.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122155
    m_Localized: WHY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122156
    m_Localized: To recover your progress on any PC, for the global rankings and for matchmaking. We do not use it for advertising or share it with anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122157
    m_Localized: WHERE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122158
    m_Localized: In the game database (Supabase). Matches use Photon servers, which receive your player name, account ID and connection (IP address).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122159
    m_Localized: YOUR RIGHTS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122160
    m_Localized: You can view your data in your in-game Profile and delete your account and its data from this launcher (Argentine Personal Data Protection Law 25.326).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122161
    m_Localized: GOT IT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7518122162
    m_Localized: SIGN OUT?
