    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899590
    m_Localized: Sign in on the launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899591
    m_Localized: Open the launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899592
    m_Localized: Sign in with your account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899593
    m_Localized: Press Play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899594
    m_Localized: If the launcher isn't on this PC, download it from the game's guide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899595
    m_Localized: Your session ended
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899596
    m_Localized: 'Your account''s session was closed, for example from the launcher. Sign in there again to keep playing: your progress is saved in your account.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899597
    m_Localized: 'You need an account to play. Open the launcher, sign in with your account and press Play: the game opens with it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899598
    m_Localized: '<color=#F29A38><b>Simulated purchases.</b></color>  This is a university project: no real money is charged. It tests how the store of a free-to-play game would work.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899599
    m_Localized: 1 purchase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899600
    m_Localized: 'You have no tickets: redeem credits or crystals'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899601
    m_Localized: With an account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899602
    m_Localized: Needs confirmation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899603
    m_Localized: No account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899604
    m_Localized: Didn't get it? <color=#F29A38><u>Request another code</u></color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899605
    m_Localized: You're playing without an account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899606
    m_Localized: In the released game, the account is managed from the launcher. Here, in the editor, you can create one or sign in to test.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899607
    m_Localized: 'The account is managed from the launcher: sign in there and press Play.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899608
    m_Localized: Your progress in the cloud, on any PC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899609
    m_Localized: Show up in the global ranking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899610
    m_Localized: Find matches with other players
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899611
    m_Localized: "Your account \xB7 One step left"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899612
    m_Localized: Confirm your email
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899613
    m_Localized: Wrong email? <color=#F29A38><u>Change it</u></color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899614
    m_Localized: Meanwhile, you keep playing as usual.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899615
    m_Localized: In the editor, the launcher's session or the one opened here is used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899616
    m_Localized: You signed in from the launcher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899617
    m_Localized: In the cloud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899618
    m_Localized: 'To switch accounts or sign out, use the <color=#F3F4F6>launcher</color>: the account menu is at the top, next to Settings.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899619
    m_Localized: In the editor you go back to the progress without an account. The account's data stays saved in it and comes back when you sign in (in the released game, from the launcher).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899620
    m_Localized: You signed out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899621
    m_Localized: In the released game, the account is changed from the launcher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899622
    m_Localized: What we store
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899623
    m_Localized: Your email, your name, your progress, your stats and your feedback. We use them to save your progress, build the ranking and find matches. We don't share them with anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899624
    m_Localized: Read the full notice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899625
    m_Localized: 'Done: your account is active'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899626
    m_Localized: We sent you another code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899627
    m_Localized: New account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899628
    m_Localized: Password
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899629
    m_Localized: Repeat the password
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899630
    m_Localized: <u>Sign in</u>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899631
    m_Localized: By creating the account you accept the <color=#F29A38><u>privacy notice</u></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899632
    m_Localized: "Creating\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899633
    m_Localized: We sent a code to your email
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899634
    m_Localized: "Signing in\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899635
    m_Localized: You signed in to your account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899636
    m_Localized: Don't have an account? <color=#F29A38><u>Create account</u></color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899637
    m_Localized: Your email and your password (encrypted), your name, your progress (achievements, cosmetics, coins), your match stats and the feedback you send.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899638
    m_Localized: What for
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899639
    m_Localized: Where
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899640
    m_Localized: In the game's database (Supabase). Matches go through Photon's servers, which receive your player name, your account id and your connection (IP), like any online game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899641
    m_Localized: Your rights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899642
    m_Localized: You can see your data in the Profile and delete your account with everything in it from the launcher, in the account menu (Argentine Personal Data Protection Law 25,326).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899643
    m_Localized: Enter a valid email.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899644
    m_Localized: The password needs 8 characters or more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899645
    m_Localized: The passwords don't match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899646
    m_Localized: That email already has an account.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899647
    m_Localized: The email or password don't match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899648
    m_Localized: Your email isn't confirmed yet. We sent you another code.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899649
    m_Localized: Your session expired. Sign in again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899650
    m_Localized: Enter the 6 digits of the code.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899651
    m_Localized: The code expired or isn't correct. Request another one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899652
    m_Localized: This needs an internet connection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899653
    m_Localized: We sent you a code a moment ago. Wait a minute and request another one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899654
    m_Localized: Accounts need the online service, which isn't configured in this version.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899655
    m_Localized: Couldn't send the email. Try again in a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899656
    m_Localized: Couldn't complete it. Try again in a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899657
    m_Localized: The password isn't correct.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899658
    m_Localized: Couldn't verify your account. Sign in again on the launcher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899659
    m_Localized: How was your experience? <color=#8E96A3><size=18>(optional)</size></color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899660
    m_Localized: It reaches the team with your name and the version. No personal data, please.
    m_Metadata:
