  - m_Id: 7534899812
    m_Localized: Tactical mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899813
    m_Localized: Invasion mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899814
    m_Localized: 'Room '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899815
    m_Localized: "Waiting for the host  \xB7  the match starts when they finish loading"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899816
    m_Localized: "Waiting for other players  \xB7  the match starts when everyone has loaded"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899817
    m_Localized: Crouch with {Agacharse} before shooting to reduce bullet spread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899818
    m_Localized: Reload with {Recargar} before peeking, before the shooting starts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899819
    m_Localized: Moving increases bullet spread. Stop before shooting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899820
    m_Localized: Headshots deal more damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899821
    m_Localized: Use your character ability with {Habilidad}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899822
    m_Localized: Change key bindings, sensitivity and your crosshair in Options or the pause menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899823
    m_Localized: Hold Tab to view the scoreboard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899824
    m_Localized: Hold {Plantar} at a site to plant the device. Moving cancels planting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899825
    m_Localized: Open the shop with {Tienda} during the buy phase while inside your base.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899826
    m_Localized: Drop your weapon with {Soltar} to give it to a teammate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899827
    m_Localized: If you carry the device, equip it with {Dispositivo}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899828
    m_Localized: You respawn at the start of the next round. Stay alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899829
    m_Localized: Losing consecutive rounds gives you more money for the next one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899830
    m_Localized: Defenders defuse the device by holding {Plantar} beside it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899831
    m_Localized: You respawn after a few seconds in Deathmatch. Keep moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899832
    m_Localized: Switch weapons with {ArmaPrincipal}, {ArmaSecundaria} and {Cuchillo}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899833
    m_Localized: Each wave is harder than the last. Save your ammo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899834
    m_Localized: If enemies surround you, switch to your knife with {Cuchillo} instead of reloading.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
