  - m_Id: 7534899965
    m_Localized: 'One team plants the device at A or B while the other defends. No respawns: if you die, spectate a teammate until the next round.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899966
    m_Localized: Free-for-all. Choose your weapons for free, heal 50 health per kill, and respawn after 3 seconds away from opponents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534899967
    m_Localized: Face 10 waves alone at university. Then continue in endless mode to set a new record.
