      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900079
    m_Localized: "Note for the PO \xB7 Sprint 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900080
    m_Localized: Hi, Amin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900081
    m_Localized: This is the Sprint 1 delivery of Project Riftwalker. Here is what already works and what is still missing so you know what to test.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900082
    m_Localized: 'Movement: walk, sprint, jump and crouch, with gravity, collisions and respawning if you fall off the map.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900083
    m_Localized: "Weapons: La Porte\xF1a pistol, Mitre rifle and knife. Damage by hit zone (head, body and legs) and range, spread, recoil, reloading and bullet marks on walls."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900084
    m_Localized: 'Shop: buy, sell and undo purchases during the buy phase while inside the buy zone. Shields provide protection.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900085
    m_Localized: 'HUD: health, shield, weapon and ammunition, crosshair and hit marker. Abilities show their cooldown.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900086
    m_Localized: 'Menus: main menu with music, video, sound and controls settings, player name, credits and pause menu (resume, restart, options and exit).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900087
    m_Localized: "Other weapons: the shop shows them all, but only the La Porte\xF1a pistol, Mitre and knife are currently usable. The others can be bought but cannot be used yet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900088
    m_Localized: 'Grenades: purchasable, but cannot be thrown yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900089
    m_Localized: 'Ability: Silbato charges and appears in the HUD, but has no effect yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900090
    m_Localized: 'Modes and multiplayer: Tactical and Deathmatch show a room, but online connectivity is still missing. Zombie does not have zombies yet: Play opens the university map to explore with weapons, the shop and the HUD.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900091
    m_Localized: 'Achievements: the screen exists but has no achievements yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7534900092
    m_Localized: 'Maps and opponents: Tests and Tests 2 open temporary maps to demonstrate gameplay. In Tests, enemies chase you and can be killed but do not attack yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
