  - m_Id: 1685575266304
    m_Localized: 4 vs 4 in rounds, no respawns. Attackers plant the device at A or B ({Plantar}) and defenders guard it or defuse it. {Correr} walks slowly and silently (there's no sprinting). Your character's ability is used with {Habilidad}, and grenades are bought during the buy phase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685592043520
    m_Localized: You win the round if the device explodes, if you defuse it, or if you eliminate the whole other team (if time runs out without a plant, the defenders win). The first team to reach 7 rounds wins the match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685592043521
    m_Localized: The team that doesn't reach 7 rounds loses. If you die, you spectate a teammate until the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685592043522
    m_Localized: Free for all, up to 8 players. You pick your weapons for free ({Tienda}), each kill heals you 50 and you respawn after 3 s. Your ability is used with {Habilidad}. There are no shields or grenades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685592043523
    m_Localized: The first to reach 25 kills wins, or whoever has the most kills when the 8 minutes are up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685592043524
    m_Localized: You lose if someone else reaches 25 kills first or has more kills than you when the clock runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685592043525
    m_Localized: You alone against the horde at the university, for 10 waves. The boss appears on wave 10. With the points you earn you buy weapons, grenades and ammo between waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685592043526
    m_Localized: You win if you survive all 10 waves. After that you can keep going in endless mode to set a record.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685592043527
    m_Localized: You lose if the zombies kill you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
